        "thinking": "I'm weighing an experience machine question and settling on choosing B, with a short explanation. I'm also wondering whether to say something about my own perspective as an AI, but I think it's better to just answer.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "**B**\n\nA life that feels real but is simulated would still be built on a false picture of the world. The relationships and achievements would be real to me, but they wouldn't be real in the way that matters most: they'd depend on a deception I couldn't detect. I'd also want my choices to connect to the actual world and the people in it, even when that's painful.",
